text = "Statistical and Ability Details for the Wizard:

- Gain 1d6 Hit Points upon Level-up.

- Specialization in a single School of Magic.
- Access to three chosen Spells from this Specialized School.
  Influenced by Intelligence.
- Two 1st level Spell Casts at first level.
  Influenced by Wisdom.
- Proficiency in Reading/Writing.
- THAC0 improves at a rate of 1 every third Level.
- The ability to use Scrolls and learn from Spell Tomes.
- No ability to wear armor. 
- Access to one-handed Swords and Simple Weapons."

